161 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (The first conversation tests the assumption that a bio-based product must automatically be greener. The team discusses a life-cycle assessment \(LCA\) of its coolant manufacturing route, the energy needed by industrial bioprocesses, the trade-offs around biological feedstocks, and why engineered production can be difficult to sustain over time.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
