<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 92 0 R
/E (Q. Why can routine supplies become a research bottleneck?)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
236 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 92 0 R
/E (A. Labs may depend on a small number of overseas suppliers for enzymes, competent cells and synthesis materials. Import costs, distributor mark-ups, customs delays and cold-chain requirements can make timelines and budgets unpredictable.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
