/P 94 0 R
/E (A. The speaker argued for risk-proportionate pathways. Clearly defined, contained work with well-characterised, low-risk systems may be suitable for simpler procedures, while work involving human use or environmental release warrants stronger scrutiny. This is a policy position from the discussion, not permission to bypass applicable rules.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
